	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Quas<note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1"><persName ref="p8417">Musculus</persName>' Brief vom 19. November 1545 <hi>(HBBW</hi> XV, <ref target="file12334">Nr. 2287</ref>). -<persName ref="p495">Bullinger</persName> hatte den Brief nie beantwortet; s. <bibl source="b18">HBBW XV</bibl> 677 und Anm. 6.</note> per <persName ref="p7228">filium<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2"><persName ref="p7228">Huldrych Zwingli d.J.</persName></note> Zwinglii</persName> beatę memorię <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>misi, <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName> in domino charissime, non dubito, <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>quin acceperis.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div2" corresp="regest2">
				<p>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Quod ad vocationem dilecti <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>fratris nostri <persName ref="p8018">Ioannis Halleri</persName> attinet, posteaquam <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>ille nostrę se accommodavit ecclesię et ad <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>concordiam<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" n="3">Damit ist die <placeName ref="l18">Augsburger</placeName> Gottesdienstordnung gemeint (s. <bibl source="b18">HBBW XV</bibl> 693,27), die unter Anleitung <persName ref="p467">Bucers</persName> 1537 verfasst wurde; s. <bibl source="b18">HBBW XV</bibl> 657, Anm. 1. - Vgl. <ref target="file12374">Nr. 2327</ref>,10-13.</note> in articulo cęnę dominicę pio sensu <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>intellectam consensit, melius contentus sum, <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>quam nonnulli hic ecclesiasticę pacis parum <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>amantes putant.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Proinde persuasum tibi <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>volo <persName ref="p8018">Hallerum</persName> mihi commendatiorem fore, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>quam maleconsulti homines<note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4">Wie z.B. <persName ref="p8354">Georg Frölich</persName> (vgl. <bibl source="b18">HBBW XV</bibl> 656f. 699,39-48), <persName ref="p1860">Michael Keller</persName> (vgl. <ref target="file12370">Nr. 2323</ref>,18f) und möglicherweise auch <persName ref="p8173">Sixt Birck</persName> (s. <bibl source="b113">Bodenmann</bibl> 357f).</note> divinant.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Habet <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>hęc urbs nostra mirabilia quędam et irre<lb xml:id="p1z13"/>quieta ingenia, quę me iam olim magno <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>tędio afficiunt, et eo adigunt, ut sępenumero <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>de migratione cogitem;<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5">Vgl. <bibl source="b18">HBBW XV</bibl> 692,11-14. 694,38f.</note> quorum insolentiam <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>nemo primo aspectu cognoscet, sed ad co<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>gnitionem illius prolixa quadam opus est <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>experientia.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Sunt iuxta hic multi boni <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>viri, quorum consuetudine <persName ref="p8018">Hallerus</persName> tuto <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>poterit uti.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div3" corresp="regest3">
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Quam acceptus sit ecclesię nostrę, <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>ipsa populi in concionibus ipsius frequentia <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>satis declaravit.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Et ipsis dominis<note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6">Die <placeName ref="l18">Augsburger</placeName> Ratsherren.</note> quam sit gratus, <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>perspicuis argumentis cognoscere potuit.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Nec <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>dubito, quin id ex illorum literis<note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7">Zum lobenden Brief des Rates von <placeName ref="l18">Augsburg</placeName> vom 5. Januar 1546 (Zürich StA, A 202/1, Nr. 8) s. <bibl source="b18">HBBW XV</bibl> 635, Anm. 5.</note> facile intelligas.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z25"/>Fratres symmystę polliciti sunt ei omnem <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>humanitatem et <foreign xml:lang="el">ϕιλαδελϕίαν</foreign><note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" ana="lex" n="8">Bruderliebe.</note>.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Reliquum est, <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>ut vocationi isti dominus gratiam incrementi <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>sui accommodet illamque et glorię suę <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>et ecclesię huic fructiferam reddat.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div4" corresp="regest4">
				<p>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z30"/>Cęterum de colloquio <placeName ref="l410">Ratisponensi</placeName><note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9">Das Zweite <placeName ref="l410">Regensburger</placeName> Religionsgespräch; s. <ref target="file12375">Nr. 2328</ref>, Anm. 17.</note> nihildum audio certi.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z31"/>Conventus protestantium, qui iam <placeName ref="l157">Francovadi</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>habetur,<note xml:id="fn10" type="footnote" n="10">Der Schmalkaldische Bundestag zu <placeName ref="l157">Frankfurt</placeName>; s. <ref target="file12366">Nr. 2319</ref>, Anm. 50.</note> satis fertur esse ad resistendum <lb xml:id="p1z33"/>conatibus antichristi unanimis et concors.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z34"/>Vestrum erit isthic christiano consensu dominum <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>nobiscum precari, ut machinas illas antichristianę <lb xml:id="p1z36"/>factionis brachio potentię suę destruat.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div5" corresp="regest5">
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p1z37"/>Bene in domino vale, <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName> charissime.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutem, <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>obsecro, d. <persName ref="p8011">Gvalthero</persName> ac reliquis in domino fratribus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z39"/><placeName ref="l18">Augustae</placeName>, 1546, 4. ianuarii.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z40"/><persName ref="p8417">Wolfg. Musculus</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z41"/>tuus in domino.<pb type="edition" next="80"/></s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Praestantissimo theologo <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>d. <persName ref="p495">Heinricho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>antistiti <placeName ref="l587">Tigurinę</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>ecclesię, domino <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>ac fratri charissimo<note xml:id="fn11" type="footnote" n="11"><persName ref="p8018">Johannes Haller</persName> nahm diesen Brief bei seiner Rückreise nach <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName> mit.</note>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
